(Phnom Penh): On the morning of May 30, 2022, the criminal police of Tuol Kork district sent the perpetrator to her husband, 27-year-old Phuong Ratha, who cut his wife's shoulder with a machete and killed her in a pool. The blood was taken to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to be handed over to the prosecutor's office to open an investigation and to prosecute the perpetrator in accordance with the law in force.
The assailant was arrested in front of the Police Inspectorate of Khan Prek Pnov, National Road 5, Samrong Village, Sangkat Samrong, Khan Prek Pnov, Phnom Penh. 15 Village 4, Sangkat Boeung Kak I, Khan Toul Kork, Phnom Penh, on May 27, 2022 at around 18:30.
The assailant was very angry with his wife, accusing her of adultery and trying to run away. At around 6:30 pm on the same day, while the victim was playing with his mobile phone and looking at Facebook, the suspect took a paring knife from the kitchen and cut off the victim's head, causing it to break. The head came out of the body, bleeding and drowning on the spot.
After killing his wife, the assailant put his wife's head in a sack of rice containing about 5 kilograms of rice in the sack, then the assailant locked the room and took the sack of rice with his wife's head. Stairs come down to the ground floor.
On May 28, 2022, at around 2:40 PM, the assailant escaped on National Road No. 05, Samrong Village, Sangkat Samrong, Khan Prek Pnov, Phnom Penh, with the intention of escaping to Kampong Chhnang Province. Detain the perpetrator and bring him to the Tuol Kork Police Inspectorate for legal action.
