(Tbong Khmum): In the afternoon of May 28, 2022, 28 11th and 12th grade students of Bun Rany Hun Sen Kdol Phsar and 6 teachers participated in a classroom forum on the history of Democratic Kampuchea (1975-). 1979) held at Koh Thmor Document Center, Tbong Khmum Province.
