Kampong Cham Provincial Election Commission resumed its trial on 28 May in the presence of the plaintiffs and defendants. Kampong Cham Provincial Election Commission fined Mr. Kong Raya 5 million Riels in accordance with Article 171 and Article 181 on Commune / Sangkat Council Election.
