Minister of Health Receives Executive Director of ASEAN-Europe Business Council
The Executive Director of the ASEAN-Europe Business Council pays a courtesy call and discusses work at the Ministry of Health.
To begin with, the Minister welcomed and appreciated the ASEAN-EU business, especially the Asia-Europe Foundation, which co-sponsored the Ministry of Health in organizing the Asia-Europe Forum on Combating Counterfeit and Substandard Drugs in Cambodia. Cambodia, despite the circumstances in which the world and Cambodia face the spread of cholera-19.
The Minister pointed out that so far, more than 4,000 health products from European countries have been registered with the Ministry of Health and circulated in the Cambodian market.
The Executive Director of the ASEAN-Europe Business Council expressed his appreciation to the Royal Government of Cambodia under the wise and prudent leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, who has been in control of the spread of Kovid-19. To re-launch the country.
He also thanked the Royal Government for vaccinating all Kovid-19 foreigners in Cambodia free of charge, including European investors and businessmen. He also thanked the Ministry of Health for its continued support for European businesses, especially in the registration of health products, and requested that the Ministry of Health continue to support and expand cooperation in the health sector.
Finally, the Minister thanked the ASEAN-EU Business Council and requested to expand cooperation between the Ministry of Health and the ASEAN-EU Business Council not only in ASEAN but also in the bilateral framework, especially on human resource development. .
The meeting ended with a proud result in the spirit of solidarity, friendship and cooperation between the ASEAN-Europe Business Council and Cambodia.
