Spokesman for the Royal Government of Cambodia assesses that the Zero Coverage strategy implemented by China is the right and effective strategy.
(Phnom Penh): In a recent interview with Cambodia-China Friendship Radio, HE Phay Siphan, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister and Chairman of the Spokesperson Unit of the Royal Government of Cambodia, said that the use of the country's zero-off strategy China is the right and effective decision of the Chinese leadership.
His Excellency explained that the Chinese population is large, so wherever there is a case of Kovid, immediate action must be taken to prevent it from spreading further.
