According to the police, the munitions were handed over by the planters, including 18 60mm rounds made in China, 17 warheads and 9 rounds of ammunition.
Currently, these bullets have been handed over to the Mukharah Administrative Police Station, and the specialized unit has reported to the Mine Action Unit to be stored and stored for the specialized forces to burn and destroy later.
