Samdech Techo Hun Sen to Address the 27th International Conference on "The Future of Asia" on May 26-27
(Phnom Penh): The Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen will join the Heads of State / Government and senior dignitaries from other Asian countries to deliver a video address at the 27th International Conference on "The Future of Asia" Tokyo, Japan, May 26-27, 2022.
The Ministry of Foreign Affairs stated that in its video address, the Prime Minister will focus on key issues, including: economic and social recovery after the Kovid-19 crisis, continued pressure on the global security environment, geopolitical competition Between superpowers and the importance of multilateralism and international cooperation based on the rule of law.
