(Preah Vihear): Mr. Sok Sannara, Chairman of the Committee of the Cambodian People's Party, Chhep District, Preah Vihear Province, called on the people not to believe at all by the whispers and fraudulent promises of some political parties during the commune council election campaign. This 5th mandate commune must believe in what is actually seen.
