In the first four months, 1.6 million tons of rice was exported through the border with Vietnam, earning about 376.64 million USD. According to the report of the Ministry of Agriculture, as of April, the dry season rice harvest reached more than 630,000 hectares, with a total yield of more than 2.9 million tons.
