Arrested a young student and a factory worker for stabbing a young man in Kampong Ror district to avenge the old hatred
(Svay Rieng): Two suspects were detained by the police in a case of intentional violence by cutting the victim's head with a sword, causing serious injuries due to previous revenge. This incident happened at 12:15 pm on May 23, 2022 at Pring Chrum village, Preah Ponlea commune, Kampong Rou district, Svay Rieng province.
According to the district police, the suspects are 17-year-old Ngoy Samnang, a student living in Pring Chrum village, Preah Ponlea commune, Kampong Ror district, and Krouch Socheat, 26, a factory worker living in Pring Chrum village, Preah Ponlea commune, Kampong Ror district. . Police confiscated a revolver and a machete.
The victim, 16-year-old Sudara, a farmer, resided in Ang Ta Mok village, Prasot commune, Svay Teap district, Svay Rieng province. The victim's family was sent to Svay Rieng Provincial Hospital for treatment.
The suspect is currently being held at the Preah Ponlea commune administrative police station for legal action.
Very symphonic! A mentally retarded young woman died of suffocation in a rented room due to electric shock
(Phnom Penh): Sadly, a mentally retarded young woman died tragically from smoke poisoning in a rented room in case of electric shock at 7:30 am on May 23, 2022 at the third floor room. On the concrete road in Sansom Kosal 4 village, Sangkat Boeung Tumpun 1, Khan Meanchey.
The victim was 14-year-old Chey Liang Sim, a homemaker with a mental illness. His mother, Chea Sok Ngyim, 54, sells hot air on the street and lives at the scene.
The mother of the victim said that before the incident, she used to go out shopping every day and always left her mentally retarded daughter in a rented room, always locking the room because she was afraid her daughter would go out and cause trouble. Other and so on.
The woman said that after hearing that there was a fire near the store, she hurried to the locker room to remove her daughter, but opened the door and saw her daughter fainting. Unfortunately, when the ambulance arrived, the doctor said that the stroke was gone.
According to the authorities, the initial conclusion was that the suspected smoke poisoning caused suffocation, however, waiting to cooperate with the forensic expertise of the Phnom Penh Municipal Commission to conclude that died due to fire or from the exact cause.
