(Tbong Khmum): Mr. Keut Rith, Minister of Justice, this morning, May 23, 2022, presided over the official announcement of the transfer and inauguration of Mr. Chea Vannak, President of Tbong Khmum Provincial Court, replacing Mr. Chum Sar, who will be transferred. Position: President of Battambang Provincial Court.
