Taking this opportunity, Mr. Keut Rith also thanked the Governor of Tbong Khmum, provincial leaders, relevant units, as well as government officials and the Armed Forces at all levels for their support and good cooperation with the court and the prosecutor. Accompanied by Tbong Khmum Provincial Court in the past.
