He also said that Cambodia-China trade cooperation has been continuously strengthened and expanded under the vision and cooperation spirit of the top leadership of Cambodia-China, in which both sides participated in establishing a trade agreement. ASEAN-China Free Trade will push for the achievement of the Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement (RCEP).
Mr. Seang Thai said that under the bilateral framework, Cambodia and China signed the Cambodia-China Free Trade Agreement in October 2020 and entered into force in January 2022, which paved the way for Strategic partnership and promotion of economic and trade cooperation between Cambodia and China.
