Samdech Techo Hun Sen and his delegation arrive safely in Switzerland (Zurich, Switzerland): After spending more than 10 hours flying at around 1 pm on May 21, 2022 (local time) At around 6:30 pm on May 21 (Cambodian time), Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen and his delegation arrived safely in Zurich, Switzerland.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen's arrival at Zurich Airport was warmly welcomed by the Cambodian Ambassador to Switzerland, the Cambodian Permanent Representative to the World Trade Organization and representatives of the World Economic Forum.
After arriving in Zurich at around 6:30 pm on the same day (Swiss time), Samdech Techo Hun Sen will meet with more than 1,000 Cambodians from European countries. Samdech Techo's meeting with Cambodians abroad is an expression of nostalgia and a spirit of caring for all Cambodians abroad.
It should be noted that Samdech Techo Hun Sen led a delegation to fly out of Cambodia at 1 am on May 21, 2022. The presence of Samdech Techo at the World Economic Forum is at the invitation of Professor Claus Chbab, Founder and Executive Chairman of the World Economic Forum.
Accompanying Samdech Techo Prime Minister Hun Sen to attend this year's World Economic Forum include Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, Mr. Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce and other senior officials of the Royal Government of Cambodia. As well as some members of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce.
According to the Cambodian Ministry of Foreign Affairs, during his participation in the forum, Prime Minister Hun Sen will deliver a meaningful speech at the closing ceremony of the dialogue with stakeholders on "Strategic Perspectives on ASEAN" and Informal working lunch with world economic leaders under the theme "Restoring Peace and Order".
In addition to participating in the above forum, Samdech Techo Prime Minister also expects to have working meetings with the leaders of some countries, as well as receive courtesy calls from political elites and world businessmen.
The World Economic Forum is an important global forum. The presence of Samdech Techo is a testament to the global recognition of the qualifications and skills of Samdech to lead the ship "Cambodia" towards the development, progress and prosperity in all fields. This peace is the value of leadership that Cambodia has and for the leaders of countries around the world to emulate and strive to maintain.
The 2022 World Economic Forum not only shares and discusses on behalf of Cambodia, but also demonstrates Cambodia's chairmanship within the ASEAN framework, the promotion of ASEAN mission to the world, and the capacity of the Cambodian people in international politics.
Samdech Techo's personal presence in this meeting shows the prestige of Cambodia and the bringing of great historical honor to Cambodia. Mr. Nuth Puth Dara Launches 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election Campaign in Sangkat Koh Anlong Chen, Takhmao City, Kandal Province
