Please be informed that Cambodian men's volleyball team won the bronze medal for the first time in history after defeating Thailand 3 sets to 2 sets, while in the group stage, Cambodia lost to Thailand 3 sets to 2 sets in the SEA Games. 31st in Vietnam on May 21, 2022.
