Samdech Techo Hun Sen Delighted to See the First Day Campaign Run Smoothly Without Conflict (Video inside) (Switzerland): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, expressed his pleasure at seeing the Commune / Sangkat Council Election Campaign Fifth, on this first day, the process went smoothly without violence and clashes.
