The Prime Minister of Cambodia also revealed that not only the vaccine source supplied more than 20 million doses, while some friendly countries in Europe are also negotiating to provide vaccine to Cambodia. Therefore, Samdech intends to ask the Chinese government to delay the supply of vaccines in order to accept the vaccines that are planned to be sent from other friendly countries for use first, while the domestic vaccines are also being prepared for production.
Meanwhile, the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia confirmed that the establishment of a local vaccine factory is a precaution because it is not known in the future that the virus does not transform into anything else. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the virus should not be neglected and that Cambodia is currently building 19 Kovid hospitals that can accommodate up to 10,000 patients.
Key Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen Meets More Than 2,100 Cambodians in Europe
* As the beginning of the conversation with the Cambodians in Europe, Samdech Techo Hun Sen brought the message of the King and the Queen Mother to all Cambodians who participated in the conversation and lived in Europe.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen informed the participants that the trip to Europe now Samdech has tried to use the national plane and the next day can arrange to travel to Europe using the national plane to follow the route that Samdech used.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Cambodian people in Europe for their support, respect and love for Samdech and the Royal Government led by Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered the demonstration against Samdech's journey by about 10 Cambodians in Europe just a process of democracy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on Cambodians to support Samdech not to retaliate against his opponents. Samdech Techo called for tolerance to be of great benefit to national unity.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech was pleased with the monks and the Cambodian people abroad who were curious to hear about the process of the nation, that Samdech, the national leader, could clearly explain the process of this nation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is not easy to make the Cambodian economy grow at around 7% per year for two consecutive decades. Samdech Techo said that this result came from a strong effort.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's good economic growth was dragged down by the Kovid 19 crisis to 2.4 percent.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Kovid 19 crisis has affected the service sector, namely the tourism sector, the most serious.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the war against Kovid 19 is not easy, it requires high attention to protect the well-being of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the introduction of measures to block in Phnom Penh and suspend the New Year makes Samdech pity the people but have no choice.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the opposition group criticized Samdech for preparing the coffin and the place where the body of the 19 Kovids was buried, but this measure was to help the body of the 19 Kovids to be properly cared for.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia received a total of 52 million doses of the vaccine and 42 million doses were used. Of that amount, 28.5 million doses is that Cambodia uses the national budget to buy, which shows that Cambodia does not allow people to die from Kovid 19 disease.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Kovid 19 vaccination program was successful because Cambodia has launched a mass vaccination program in Phnom Penh and Kandal province before moving on to other provinces.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the launch of this concentration vaccination program has led to Cambodia building strong community resilience and preventing its rapid spread.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the 19 events of Kovid have awakened the people to pay attention to hygiene in life.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the reason for the delay in setting up the vaccine factory was because the Royal Government had not yet signed the purchase of the vaccine. Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that the Royal Government has now signed an agreement to purchase a vaccine produced by this factory in Cambodia. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that so far, Cambodia does not lack vaccines for people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the establishment of a local vaccine factory is a preparation because he does not know that in the future, the virus does not transform into anything else.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the virus should not be neglected and that Cambodia is currently building 19 Kovid hospitals that can accommodate up to 10,000 patients.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the vaccination policy in Cambodia is successful because the vaccine in Cambodia does not adhere to political, racial, religious or color trends.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that Samdech was advised to take money from vaccination for those who could afford it, but Samdech refused and gave the vaccination free of charge.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the Kovid 19 crisis caused the Royal Government to release about 40 million dollars per month to help people affect their lives.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Kovid 19 crisis caused the Royal Government to spend more than 2 billion dollars. Samdech Techo stated that money can be earned, it is important to protect the lives of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he did not expect that the country with high medical standards would suffer the most. This shows that the determinants of the success of the fight against Kovid 19 are in the management, not in medical or technological advances.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the withdrawal of the EBA from Europe will not affect Cambodia's exports. According to the report, last year, Cambodia's trade volume between Cambodia and Europe reached more than 4 billion US dollars. Cambodia exports more than $ 3 billion to Europe.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the garment sector is doing well as orders are increasing. About 500 factories are increasing production hours.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the crisis of the Russia-Ukraine war had a greater impact than the crisis of Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Europe was hit harder than Asia caused by the Russia-Ukraine war crisis.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns all local Cambodians not to be deceived by the propaganda about gas prices.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the crisis caused by the Russia-Ukraine war cannot be estimated as Russia is the world's largest supplier of oil, gas and wheat.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs Mr. Roth to listen, research and compile more benefits from peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is gratifying that the opening day of the election campaign did not happen.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on all political parties to win with dignity and not to create any violence.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges political parties to take policy to compete with each other, not to insult and attack each other.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has stated that for the past 24 years, Cambodians have not been killed, injured or maimed by war. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that for 24 years Cambodia has not had widows and orphans due to the war. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that for 24 years, no people had fled the war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that for 24 years, Cambodia has not had any roads, bridges, schools, pagodas due to the war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that bullets do not recognize human rights.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the absence of the flames of war provides an opportunity for Cambodia to organize the process of democracy and human rights.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the presence of peace, the absence of war provides opportunities for socio-economic development and poverty reduction.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the rice surplus forced Cambodia to sell rice to neighboring countries, leading to Cambodia losing the benefits of rice processing.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that his policy was to turn the former battlefield into a commercial and development zone.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reaffirms the demarcation of the border with Vietnam, which has achieved a total of 90 percent. In response to the accusation that the Royal Government cut the land for Vietnam, Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that if the land was cut for Vietnam as alleged, there would be no need to spend time negotiating until now.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the trade volume between Cambodia and Vietnam when Kovid 19 reached 9.5 billion dollars. In that, Cambodia exports to Vietnam more than imports from Vietnam.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia needs to have good relations with neighboring countries. Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked those who want to attack Vietnam whether Vietnam has no arms?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government is preparing to facilitate the issuance of ID cards to Cambodians abroad to make it easier for them to live and do business in Cambodia. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodians abroad do not need to apply for a Royal Decree to gain Cambodian citizenship.
