The distribution of gifts to the above people was held on the afternoon of May 19, 2022 at the Department of Cult and Religion of Kampong Thom Province, in the presence of Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Governor of Kampong Thom and some representatives of philanthropists.
Mr. Mak Bunhong, Governor of Stung Sen City, said that all these donations are from the participation of local and foreign philanthropists who support through the Religious denomination association of Jesus Christ and the Association of Young Scholars and Students of Kampong Thom Province (subordinate). Department of Cult and Religion of Kampong Thom Province).
