(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and ASEAN Chair, urged ASEAN and the BRICS countries (Brazil, Russia, India, China and South Africa) as well as the international community to redouble their efforts to restore multilateralism. An essential element of unity in solving problems is happening in the world.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen's insistence was made through his intervention in the second forum of political parties, research groups and civil society organizations from countries (BRICS) on May 19, 2022.
In this intervention, Samdech Techo stated that in the context of a rapidly changing, uncertain and complex world, one cannot abandon or turn away from multilateral mechanisms if one really intends to address the challenges. Overall at present.
