* 1: NEC call for dissemination to all business owners, companies, factories, hotels, restaurants and establishments in the Kingdom of Cambodia to facilitate and facilitate workers to travel to vote. On Sunday, June 5, 2022.
Letter of request to the Ministry of Interior to intervene to all presidents of private security companies and casinos in the Kingdom of Cambodia to allow security staff and casino staff to go to the Commune / Sangkat Council elections for the fifth mandate in 2022, which will take place On Sunday, June 5, 2022.
Letter of request to the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training to intervene to all factories, enterprises, restaurants and establishments within the scope of the Labor Law to allow employees to go to the Commune / Sangkat Council elections for the fifth mandate in 2022 Which will take place on Sunday, June 5, 2022.
* 2: Decision on the procedures and procedures for filling additional reserve candidates of political parties that will receive seats in the Commune / Sangkat Council.
* 3: Educational video spots, music videos, gestures, animated video spots for broadcast on radio and television to educate voters in the 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election 2022.
* 4: Decision on the establishment of the Preliminary Election Results Management Committee for the 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election 2022.
