* NEC call for outreach to all business owners, companies, factories, hotels, restaurants and establishments in Cambodia to facilitate and facilitate workers to travel back and forth to vote on the 5th Sunday of the month June 2022.
* Letter of request to the Ministry of Interior to intervene to all presidents of private security companies and casinos in Cambodia to allow security staff and casino staff to go to the Commune / Sangkat Council elections for the fifth mandate in 2022, which will take place on Sunday, June 5, 2022.
Letter of request to the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training to intervene to all factories, enterprises, restaurants and establishments within the scope of the Labor Law to allow workers to go to the polls for the 5th mandate Commune / Sangkat Council in 2022. Will take place on Sunday, June 5, 2022.
