Decision on the procedure and procedure for filling additional reserve candidates of political parties that will receive seats in Commune / Sangkat Councils.
* Educational video spots, music videos, gestures, animated video spots for broadcast on radio and television to educate voters in the 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election 2022.
Decision on the Establishment of the Preliminary Election Results Management Committee for the 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election 2022.
Decision on allowing special guests for the 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election 2022 in Cambodia to observe the election at polling stations and counting stations. According to the decision, the special guest is a representative of the embassy or foreign representative in Cambodia.
