Two-star soldier shoots himself to death
(Phnom Penh): A two-star military officer decided to shoot himself in the morning on May 18, 2022, at 139, Street 656, Preah Ponlea Village, Prek Pra Sangkat, Chbar Ampov District.
According to the report, the victim was Heng Saran, 50 years old, military occupation, Deputy Director of the Department of Geography in charge of the Military Geography Training Center, rank of Major General, residence at home.
According to Ou Sophany, 42, the victim's wife, her husband had been suffering from headaches and dizziness for more than 10 days. He was told to go to the hospital, but the victim refused, so she went to the market to buy fruit to bring to her husband.
At 9:47 a.m., when he returned home, he entered the house through the back door and found his dead husband lying on the bed with a pistol.
Separately, Hem Bunthorn, a 45-year-old male co-worker, claimed that before the incident, the victim walked out of the house through the back door and sat on the bench in the military geography department. After sitting and chatting with the victim for a while, the victim said that he had a bad headache and walked back into the house.
After a while, she heard a voice but did not pay attention. After a while, the victim's wife came out and walked into the house through the back door, suddenly surprised that her husband is dead. Conclusion The victim died of a gunshot wound (committed suicide). After the autopsy, all the bodies were handed over to the families for the traditional rites.
According to the report, the victim, Heng Saran, 50 years old, military occupation, was the Deputy Director of the Geography Department in charge of the Military Geography Training Center, with the rank of Major General.
At 9:47 a.m., when he returned home and entered the back door, he found his dead husband lying on the bed with a pistol.
