Ministry of Economy Closes National Conference on Cambodia Securities Exchange "A Decade of Development of the Cambodia Securities Exchange and its Way Forward"
(Phnom Penh): On May 18, 2022, at the Cambodia Securities Exchange and through the online Zoom system, the Ministry of Economy and Finance closed the National Conference on the Cambodia Securities Exchange "A Decade of Development of the Cambodia Securities Exchange and its Progress." The event was attended by 400 representatives from ministries, institutions, the private sector, development partners, associations, national and international dignitaries.
The conference was very fruitful for the participants, especially in terms of access to knowledge, information, data and trends in the progress of the securities sector in Cambodia.
Speaking at the event, Dr. Hean Sahip emphasized that the three-day National Conference was held to promote public awareness of the stock market and its role in contributing to national economic development, promoting the benefits of Financing capital from the Cambodia Securities Exchange for the private sector and disseminating investment potential in the Cambodian securities sector to both local and foreign investors.
The conference also provided an opportunity for the public, entrepreneurs and investors to gain a better understanding of the progress of the Cambodia Securities Exchange, which could be the basis for reaping the benefits of the growing potential of the Cambodia Securities Exchange.
The Secretary of State praised and appreciated the efforts of the speakers and colleagues who led, facilitated and encouraged the discussion to be lively through presentations, discussions and exchanges of views. Active and active.
The Secretary of State is optimistic that the discussions and exchanges during the conference will help clarify, resolve key issues that have hindered the development of the Securities Exchange in the Kingdom of Cambodia and find solutions to work towards The face continues.
During the conference, the Cambodia Securities Exchange (CSX) officially launched the CSX Trade mobile app, a program that provides investors with easy access to securities trading, especially easy to track and access information related to the securities sector in a timely manner. And everywhere.
