The campaign was held this morning, May 18, 2022, under the chairmanship of Ms. Soeur Socheata, Undersecretary of State, Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, and with the participation of Mr. Mom Kong, Executive Director of the Cambodian Movement for Health, as well as speakers and students. More than 300 people at the Royal University of Phnom Penh.
