It should be noted that this meeting is supported by the Cambodian Climate Change Alliance (CCCA) program, with the participation of leaders and experts of the Ministry of Environment, the Climate Change Technical Working Group, development partners, the private sector and many educational institutions in order to monitor progress. The work of the NDC monitoring and evaluation system will determine priorities for subsequent activities, mobilization of resources and suggestions from stakeholders.
The meeting reviewed and decided on the preliminary results of the NDC monitoring and evaluation system and collected input, as well as good recommendations for the implementation of the next steps. The meeting also presented the progress of the implementation of the NDC by sector in 2021 by representatives of relevant ministries and discussed the planning of inter-ministerial and development partners to implement the NDC in 2022.
