In other words, in the case of the head of state or the head of the Royal Government, who is the head of diplomacy of a foreign state, who comes on an official mission and is subjected to assault, endangerment of life or violence in any way, it is considered the host state. That is a barbaric state without ancient civilization called "wild people" living without rules.
