He said that Chamkar Andong commune is one of the eight communes of Chamkar Leu district, Kampong Cham province. Prior to 2016, within the framework of party infrastructure, the Chamkar Andong commune party committee did not have a party headquarters, ie the party headquarters was housed under the house of Mr. Ith Nith, chairman of the commune party committee, which was his dedication to the party cause.
Mr. Bou Tharin added that the presence of the Chamkar Andong commune party headquarters is a new achievement of the CPP committee in Chamkar Andong commune, and it will be a historic achievement for the CPP committee in Chamkar Andong commune and for Member of the Cambodian People's Party, Chamkar Andong commune. The building will be a multi-purpose building within the political, administrative, social and economic framework.
No matter what the circumstances, the CPP and its leaders are always with the people, listening and resolving their difficulties. The CPP has the right leadership, clear policies, adherence to the principles of peacekeeping, a culture of sharing and sharing with the people, and these factors make the CPP support and respect. The people will be strong to this day and forever.
