Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of meeting with Samdech Techo Hun Sen Youth Volunteer Doctors (Phnom Penh): After completing the busy mission on American waters this morning, May 17, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen The Prime Minister of Cambodia continued to meet with a group of Samdech Techo Youth Volunteer Doctors.
A get-together was held at the Chroy Changva Gallery. This conversation was held to encourage all the volunteer doctors who have contributed responsibly, without fear of fatigue, without fear of infection, in the mission to fight Kovid 19.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen spoke for more than 2 hours, the following are the main points of Samdech Techo's speech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in addition to TYDA doctors, Samdech Techo will also meet with other doctors such as Samdech Tea Banh, Samdech Say Chhum and Hun Many. Like the state medical team. Samdech Techo stated that this meeting was to provide an opportunity for Samdech to thank for participating in the fight against Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is not easy to gather people to join the battle of the shadowless enemy. But out of patriotism and the people, many volunteer doctors sacrificed their children, wives and husbands to fight Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the success of Kovid 19 was not a coincidence. One can understand how to manage and fight Kovid 19 using a variety of strategies.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the establishment of Samdech Techo Young Volunteer Doctors is a proper consideration and preparation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the TYDA leadership and all the volunteer doctors who volunteered for Operation Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked his parents, husband and wife for allowing their children, wife and husband to join the fight against Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Kovid 19 changed the views of the Cambodian people on the medical team by treating them as white-collar soldiers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the Ministry of Health to take care to maintain the reputation of doctors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that training in the field of health will not be able to do the same as in the field of education.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia will not abolish the provocation for pilots entering Cambodia who have not been vaccinated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that exemptions for those who have not been vaccinated from abroad are encouraging for people who have not been vaccinated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that some of his guests refused to meet him because he met tourists on the Western Dam.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that without the vaccine, the catastrophe in Cambodia caused by Kovid 19 would be serious.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was proud of the people who participated in the fight against Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that as a poor country, vaccination achieved in large numbers as it is now is not easy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia received a total of more than 52 million doses of the vaccine and consumed nearly 43 million doses. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that currently Cambodia has almost 10 million doses of vaccine left. Among the vaccines that Cambodia received, more than 28 and a half million were vaccines that Cambodia bought. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that more than 20 million doses of vaccines have not been delivered to Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the Ministry of Health to expedite the establishment of a vaccine factory while the Chinese side waits for a response from Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that the vaccination against Kovid 19, even in the 10th dose, does not take money from the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the time of the outbreak of Kovid 19 is not the time to take money from the people, it is time to help the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the Minister of Health to take Luong Mey Hospital as a specialized hospital for cancer treatment.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian economy has recovered well, but the crisis of the Russia-Ukraine war makes the economic situation in Cambodia uncertain.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the four medical forces that carried out the fight against Kovid 19 were: government doctors, military doctors, police doctors and volunteer doctors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces to the court to change the official date of birth to use the actual date of birth of Samdech is August 05, 1952.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the outcome of the ASEAN-US Special Summit is a historic result.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if Samdech did not ban, those who threw Samdech could be in danger. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there were three groups requesting Samdech to hold a demonstration to ask the United States to take action against those who threw Samdech. But Samdech forbade it.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked the United States whether the person who threw Samdech was a right to express his opinion or cause violence? Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked the United States to think carefully if it thinks that throwing shoes as a right of expression in the world is no longer orderly, including in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has made it clear that he does not demand that the United States punish those who throw shoes at him, but that American law applies that way.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the Cambodian people to respect, love and support Samdech to maintain stability without any retaliation, leaving the United States in charge. Samdech Techo Hun Sen also instructed the Cambodian ambassador to the United States not to assign any ambassador to the US government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also instructed the Cambodian ambassador to the United States not to assign any ambassador to the US government.
The ASEAN Defense Ministers 'Meeting and the ASEAN Plus Defense Ministers' Meeting, hosted by Cambodia, have begun!
