(Phnom Penh): The Standing Committee of the Senate on Tuesday morning, May 17, 2022, held a meeting chaired by Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate of the Kingdom of Cambodia with three agendas.
The three agendas include:
1. Examine and decide on the request of the Committee on Interior, National Defense, National Assembly Relations, Senate, Inspection and Public Function to submit the draft law on the amendment of Article 140 of the Law on Capital, Province, Municipality, District and Khan Administration, which shall be promulgated by Royal Kram No. NS / RKAM / 0508/017 dated 24 May 2008 in the agenda of the Senate session of the 4th Extraordinary Extraordinary Legislature.
2. Examine and decide on the request of the Commission on Public Transport, Civil Aviation, Post, Telecommunication, Industry, Mining, Energy, Trade, Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction to include the draft law on food safety in the agenda of the 4th Extraordinary Session of the Senate.
After reviewing and discussing, the Standing Committee of the Senate has set Wednesday, May 18, 2022 at 08:00 AM for the 4th Extraordinary Session of the Senate with the following agenda:
1: Review and comment on the draft law on the amendment of Article 140 of the Law on the Administration of Capital, Province, Municipality, District and Khan, which shall be promulgated by Royal Kram No. NS / RKAM / 0508/017 dated 24 May 2008.
2: Review and comment on the draft law on food safety.
