Samdech Techo Hun Sen Sends Condolences on the Death of Dr. Dul Koeun, Member of Parliament for Kandal Province
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the night of May 15, 2022, sent a message of condolences on the death of Dr. Dul Doeun, Member of Parliament for Kandal Province on May 15, 2022. 74 years old with a disease.
Through the condolence message of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, my wife and I are deeply saddened to receive the sad news that His Excellency Dr. Dul Doeun, Member of Parliament for Kandal Province, the husband of Lok Chumteav, passed away at 18:12. Sunday, the 15th day of the month of Pisak in the year of Karl Chatva Sak, BE 2565, corresponding to the 15th day of May, 2022, at the age of 74, due to illness.
In this sad time, my wife and I would like to express our deepest condolences to the late Lok Chumteav and the family of the deceased for the loss of His Excellency Dr. Dul Doeun, the husband, father, father-in-law, grandfather, and pious grandfather. Do not know how to dry to dear wife, children, grandchildren.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered the death of His Excellency Dr. Dul Doeun as a great loss of a dignitary who struggled to sacrifice his physical and mental resources, resources and mentality to serve the country in all circumstances, especially to actively contribute to the legislature in the goal. Serve the national interests of the motherland in the past.
My wife and I would like to dedicate our prayers to the soul of His Excellency Dr. Dul Doeun.
