After listening carefully to the content of the speech of Samdech Techo Prime Minister and various interpretations that are confusing or deceptive, today as a lawyer and those who have followed the case. Carefully, from the beginning until now, I would like to clarify the content of the high speech of Samdech Techo Prime Minister on some important legal aspects as follows:
* Cambodia is a sovereign state and has its own laws, which must be strictly enforced by the judiciary, which is an independent power guaranteed by the Constitution, the supreme law of the nation.
