The following is the full text of Samdech Techo Hun Sen's writing:
Brother, after you passed away without saying goodbye or sending a message to your wife, children, relatives and friends, your death was sent a message of condolence by the King and the Mother of God. The Holy King has bestowed on you the title of Samdech.
