After the welcoming ceremony yesterday evening, the President of the United States, together with Samdech Techo Hun Sen, is scheduled to chair the ASEAN-US Special Summit on May 13, 2022.
During this historic summit, ASEAN and US leaders will set out the future direction of ASEAN-US relations and will promote a strategic partnership for the mutual benefit of the people of ASEAN. And the people of the United States.
The special summit will also reaffirm the joint commitment to maintain ASEAN centrality and unity through ASEAN-led mechanisms, as well as to enhance mutual trust and confidence in maintaining peace and stability. And prosperity in the region.
