Alisara said the measures would take effect on Friday and would "make overseas operations easier while facilitating risk hedging for businesses so that risk management could be more effective". She said more measures would take effect in the coming years.
"We will focus on non-banking companies by expanding the scope of foreign exchange (FX) services and revising guidelines for flexible FX operations," she said.
