She added: "The blood donation and fundraising campaign to help Kantha Bopha Hospital will evolve into a national movement that is active and spread throughout the country to be a part of promoting the Cambodian conscience. "Khmer and the spirit of shared culture, as well as ensuring the safety of public health in order to develop the quality of human resources that are resilient and strong for the future of Cambodia."
