Taking this opportunity, the Ministry of Labor reaffirmed to the public, the public as well as all relevant institutions that "Currently, Cambodia has not yet sent seasonal workers to work abroad, requiring education. "Research on the economic situation of the country, the working conditions, the fees that workers have to pay, especially on the mechanism of repatriation to get a decent job opportunity abroad."
