As for the joint statement between China and Britain, which the United States and the West have always mentioned, the goal is to resolve the issue of Britain returning Hong Kong to China, not the issue of Hong Kong, such as what kind of political system Hong Kong should implement, including the electoral regime. Also after Hong Kong returned to China.
The United States and the West hold democracy banners for China to abide by the Sino-British joint statement. The success of the "one country, two systems" regime, moreover, is a barbaric interference and devastation to the development of Hong Kong's democracy.
