(Phnom Penh): On May 12, 2022, the General Department of Taxation decided to file a complaint to the National Police General Commission on the use of forged clothing and uniforms of a group of tax officials.
This fraud is deliberately damaging the facts presented with a clear objective and can cause serious loss of state tax revenue through this fraud. The forging of clothes and uniforms of civil servants of the General Department of Taxation is a serious offense as stated in Article 610, Article 612 of the Penal Code of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
