She also thanked Samdech Techo Hun Sen on behalf of the ASEAN Chair for his efforts in resolving issues in Myanmar.
She also noted that many US companies are currently investing and doing business in Cambodia. She saw that Cambodia and the United States have the opportunity to further strengthen economic, trade and investment cooperation. She also promised to encourage more American investors to come to Cambodia.
