According to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, these two points have left a headache that has not been resolved and caused some tensions between Cambodia and the United States. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "I can honestly say that I want to be friends with the United States, why is it so difficult? If you want to be an enemy, it should be difficult, and this is just asking to be friends, it is very difficult.
However, Samdech Techo Hun Sen still claims that Cambodia-US relations have now reached the highest level ever in history. Samdech reminded that before 2000, the United States did not have its own embassy in Cambodia, that is, rent a house to set up an embassy. But after Cambodia was completely at peace, Samdech Techo Hun Sen provided a location for the United States as an embassy, the current location near Wat Phnom.
Samdech Techo Prime Minister continued that for trade relations is the largest trade up to more than 9 billion dollars. Samdech Techo Hun Sen has made it clear that Cambodia needs economic, trade relations, does not need any foreign troops or foreign experts, and there is no need for Cambodia to need foreign troops.
In terms of deep-sea ports, the United States, France, China, Japan, Australia and the United Kingdom have all been to this location, and any country can enter as well.
