Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of meeting with approximately 2,000 Cambodians living in the United States and Canada in Washington DC
(Washington): At around 4:00 AM on May 12, Cambodian time, which is 17:00 on May 11 in Washington, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, met with Cambodian people. More than 2,000 people from the United States and Canada.
During the meeting, Samdech Techo Hun Sen spoke for more than 3 hours with Cambodians living in the United States and Canada. The following are the main messages of Samdech Techo:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen brings the Royal Message of His Majesty the King and His Majesty the Queen Mother to visit nearly 2,000 Cambodians in the United States and Canada who have met with Samdech Techo.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that it is good that digital technology was born before Kovid 19, if Kovid 19 was born before, the world will suffer.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Cambodian people in the United States and Canada for taking the time and money to meet with Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is not strange in the democratic process, there are always supporters and non-supporters.
* Samdech Cho Hun Sen stated that it is a virtue for people to take karma with people who have died.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the first four months of 2022, the trade volume with Vietnam reached 4.2 billion dollars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the demarcation of the border with Vietnam has reached 90 percent.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the 10% of the unresolved border between Cambodia and Vietnam includes the border at Dak Dam and the border in Mondulkiri province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the trade volume between Cambodia and Vietnam in the first four months of this year, Cambodia exported more goods to Vietnam than Vietnam brought to Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has achieved the result of zero Kovid 19 on the 5th day.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the monks and thanked all the people for following the measures and accepting the vaccine provided by the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia will fall into the Kovid 19 disaster if the right measures are not taken and the people do not participate.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that vaccination policy in Cambodia was successful because vaccines did not differentiate between political, racial, and religious tendencies.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is rich but not poor by buying vaccines for people free of charge. Samdech Techo stated that Samdech dared to play to protect the lives of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that at this time, Cambodia's concern is that the vaccine has not yet run out of stock.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the vaccine in stock now has up to 12 million doses.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the situation of receiving vaccine assistance from Cambodia's friendly countries is entering the stage of "beggars have money". Compare this because there are so many Cambodian vaccines left, so Cambodia asks donors to delay sending vaccines to Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is among the 10 countries with the lowest 19 Kovid cases in the world.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that due to the Russia-Ukraine war, Cambodia lowered its economic growth forecast from 5.6 percent to 5.2 percent for 2022.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the first four months of 2022, tax collection reached 53%, amounting to more than 2 billion dollars in cash.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the population below the poverty line in Cambodia is only about 8% by 2019.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the growth of exports in the industrial sector in Cambodia in the first quarter of 2022 increased by about 32 percent. Exports to the United States rose 34 percent.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that due to the supply crisis, many companies have diverted supply from Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia and Vietnam have agreed to reopen tourism by land and air.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has benefited greatly from domestic tourism. There were about 300,000 domestic tourists on the weekend.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considers the apology of the former National Rescue Activist in the United States, Brad Young, to be clean to his wife and children. Samdech Techo stated that if only the purity of his wife and children could not be protected, did Samdech have value in leading the nation?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the simple communication between Samdech and the people, the substance of Samdech's innate nature, could not correct this habit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia does not choose China against the United States or choose the United States against China.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's policy is to be peaceful, not against other countries and to follow the middle ground of ASEAN.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen tells Myanmar protesters that opposing the current ASEAN chairmanship is tantamount to opposing the well-being of the people of Myanmar as a whole.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns anti-government propagandists to make a clear distinction between the national protesters of Myanmar and the Cambodian people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns Cambodians, supporters of the Royal Government, not to respond to those who oppose Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the US Embassy is the best location. If not for the United States, Samdech would not have given it.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the trade volume between Cambodia and the United States is the largest. Of that, exports to the United States amounted to more than 9 billion US dollars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked what Cambodia needs foreign troops to do? What Cambodia needs is an economy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is just a friend of the United States, why is it so difficult?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that in a meeting with Samdech, Mr. Kem Sokha asked Samdech to go abroad. Samdech stated that going abroad is a court decision.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it was time for Cambodians in the United States to stand up for their rights and freedoms.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that what he demanded from the United States not to send Cambodians back to Cambodia was to protect the interests of Cambodians in the United States.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodians abroad must demand the right to vote in Cambodia, but must vote directly, not by post, because it is the election law of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the postal election, even in the United States, was problematic until there was a conflict between the Republican Party and the Democrats.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that while Samdech was saddened by the death of his brother, it should be an opportunity for politicians.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that any letter from opposition politicians to Samdech now is tantamount to pushing Samdech against a wall.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Mr. Kem Sokha is a smart politician, unlike some politicians.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs Cambodians in the United States to respect US law, including measures to protect Kovid 19.
