Oddar Meanchey Provincial Administration Clarified on the Making of "Cambodia-Thailand Border Card" so as not to confuse or deceive the crooks
(Oddar Meanchey): The Oddar Meanchey Provincial Administration on May 11, 2022 issued an explanation on the issuance of "Cambodia-Thailand border card" to the people so as not to be confused or cheated by some crooks. Take money from people in exchange for running this Cambodian-Thai border card.
According to the Oddar Meanchey provincial administration, some people have been confused in the past, and some opportunists have inspired people living outside of Oddar Meanchey to apply for a Cambodian-Thai border card. One-Stop-Shop in the province or at the O'Smach International Border Checkpoint through the guarantee to help run or deliver to the service location.
* One copy of border card application with photo, signature or thumbprint of the applicant on the application (the application is provided at the service point free of charge).
* Current photo of the person, size 4x6, taken in front without wearing a hat or 2 glasses.
* Khmer Nationality ID card or birth certificate or birth certificate which is the original or a true copy of the original.
Therefore, the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Administration also appealed to the people not to be deceived by the deceptive propaganda about the invitation to receive services or guarantee to run the Cambodia-Thailand border card to avoid wasting time and money in vain.
