(Phnom Penh): The General Secretariat of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy on May 11, 2022 issued a press release on the results of the 35th session of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy. This is according to the press release received by Fresh News on May 11, 2022.
This session was held under the high presidency of His Majesty the King, the Prince of Life on the Stones, the King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, with the highest reverence, the President of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy at the Royal Palace to review, decide and consult on 8 agendas with the following results:
Agenda 1: Review and decide on the decision of the Disciplinary Council of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy: The meeting decided to approve the decision of the Disciplinary Council of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy.
Agenda 2: Review and decide on the transfer and appointment of some judges: The meeting decided to approve the appointment and transfer of a total of 11 chairmen, vice chairmen and judges.
Agenda 3: Consultation on the request for transfer and appointment of prosecutors Some Deputy Prosecutors at the request of the Minister of Justice: The meeting approved the request for transfer and appointment of a total of 5 prosecutors and deputy prosecutors.
Agenda 4: Review and decide to elect 1 member of the Constitutional Council: The meeting decided to elect HE Duy Chhao as a member of the Constitutional Council for a term of 9 years (2022-2031) appointed by the Supreme Council of the Magistracy. .
Agenda 6: Review and decide on the resumption of the work of the Deputy Prosecutor General of the Supreme Court, 65 years old: The meeting decided to allow Mr. Ouk Kimsith, Deputy Prosecutor General of The Attorney General accompanies the Supreme Court.
Agenda 7: Review and decide on the request for permission to continue the study of 1 Judge of Stung Treng Provincial Court: The meeting decided to allow Mr. Mang Sohan, Judge of Stung Treng Provincial Court to take a leave of absence for 2 (two) years From September 1, 2021 to August 31, 2023, maintaining the framework and no salary for the applicant to continue their studies.
Agenda 8: Other issues: The meeting did not have any issues to raise.
At the end of the meeting, His Majesty the King of Life, the King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, in the highest esteem, the President of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy expressed his deep gratitude for the dedicated work. Of members of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy.
His Majesty the President announced the close of the 35th session of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy successfully and with a good atmosphere.
