The 100th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China (CPC) was celebrated by Chinese President Xi Jinping, who delivered a keynote speech.
BEIJING, May 10 (Xinhua) - The General Assembly of the Communist Party of China (CPC) held a grand ceremony on the morning of May 10 to mark the 100th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Youth League of China (CPC). China's Central Military Commission attended the General Assembly and delivered keynote speeches.
In July 1921, 13 deputies, with an average age of only 28, attended the first Congress of the Communist Party of China, which announced the founding of the Communist Party of China, a major event in Chinese history and the beginning of the era. New of the restoration of the glory of the Chinese nation.
Under the leadership of the Chinese Communist Party, the Chinese Communist Youth League was formed in 1922. The Chinese Youth Movement opened a new page in history. According to the recently announced White Paper on Chinese Youth in the New Era, by the end of 2021, the total number of members of the Chinese Communist Youth League has reached 73.71 million.
