Two men who used a bulldozer to plow the land in 3 areas, which are prohibited areas, were arrested and sent to Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police.
(Kampong Chhnang): Two brothers were arrested by the Armed Forces in cooperation with the Economic Crimes Police Office of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police on the morning of May 8, 2022, while the two men were plowing a bulldozer. On the land of 3 areas which are prohibited areas.
The Deputy Commander of the Royal Gendarmerie further stated that the two suspects arrested above include:
* First name: Kuon Sreng, 37 years old * Second name: Kuon Sokun, 30 years old, both are brothers and live in Poprak village, Samrong Sen commune, Kampong Leng district.
The two of them used a bulldozer to plow three and a half hectares of land in three areas, which they recently returned to the state. During the arrest of the two men, the police confiscated a pair of scissors.
Currently, the two suspects have been sent to the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police to build a case, and the evidence is kept at the Samrong Sen commune administrative post.
