Tang Kork District Governor Visits Defenders in All Communes and Urges Continues to Protect Security and Special Order During Elections
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Hak Mong Huot, Governor of Taing Kork District, Kampong Thom Province, visited the people in 8 communes of Taing Kork District to express their gratitude for their hard work to protect the security and order for the people. Local people will be instructed to continue this work, especially during the upcoming commune and parliamentary elections.
The meeting with the above People's Defense Force was held until May 8, 2022, a total of 12 locations and the last number of 897 participants was in Treal commune, one of the largest communes in Taing Kork district.
Mr. Hak Mong Huot said that during the visit to the people in the eight communes, he thanked them for their efforts to maintain security and order for the people with the police force. The strength of the pillars has also contributed to the people's well-being and livelihood.
The district governor praised the local people's defense force in Taing Kork district for participating in maintaining peace with the Royal Government of Cambodia by preventing various incitement by corrupt groups in the past. This is in line with what the Prime Minister always called and called on the people, civil servants, the armed forces, the people's defense forces to join in defending the peace at all costs.
At the same time, Governor Hak Mong Huot also requested the People's Defense Force to continue to protect and maintain security and order for the local people to continue to create an atmosphere during the 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election and The upcoming 6th National Assembly election will ensure the well-being of all people.
He also called on the People's Defense Force to continue to monitor and prevent the incitement of unscrupulous groups that intend to cause insecurity, instability and destroy the peace in order to continue to protect the peace that Cambodia has achieved.
The defenders in Taing Kork district are all determined to continue to participate in protecting the security and order of the local people, especially to try to maintain peace, but not to be destroyed by unscrupulous groups.
It should be informed that in every meeting with the defenders in each commune, Mr. Hak Mong Huot District Governor and his colleagues always have some gifts such as Sarong 1, budget 5000-10000 Riels, including solidarity food together.
Mr. Hak Mong Huot also thanked the sub-district of Tang Kork district and the chief abbot of the pagodas for facilitating the organization of the gathering of people to protect the 12 locations in the local pagodas. Ukraine: 60 people may have died under rubble after Russia bombed a village school
