The body of Samdech Hun Neng was laid to rest at his home in Village 7, Sangkat Kampong Cham, Kampong Cham City, Kampong Cham Province, according to the Buddhist tradition. 2565 On May 9, 2022, the body of Samdech Hun Neng will be buried at Wat Sovankiri Rattanak Phnom Pros, Trapeang Char Village, Krala Commune, Kampong Siem District, Kampong Cham Province.
