"The Royal Government of Cambodia, with the Ministry of Commerce as its staff, has made efforts to diversify trade by establishing free trade agreements under the multilateral, regional and bilateral frameworks, in line with legal and regulatory reforms," he said. Provisions to improve the business and investment environment in Cambodia.
At the same time, both sides expressed their commitment to continue to strengthen good relations, especially in the field of trade, to become stronger and deeper, which can help economic recovery and increase the volume of bilateral trade between Cambodia. Croatia, which currently seems to have this small amount.
