At the same time, Mr. Tep Nytha instructed the 25 CECs to prepare and provide training materials to lower-level election officials as a practical basis for recording and transmitting GPS location data. Of those designated locations for the 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election 2022 to be successful.
Commentary: Lies can not hide the truth
BEIJING (Reuters) - A US State Department website recently issued a statement slandering some Chinese officials and media outlets for spreading "fake news" on Russia's Ukraine issue to provoke military action. Russia's in Ukraine is reasonable.
If you look at this statement in detail, you will see that it is full of lies, it is pure false information. The American side's gruesome "drama about thieves" proves that it is the biggest lie maker.
In this so-called statement, the crimes committed by the US side against the Chinese side are actually reports of facts or intuitive analysis that the Chinese side has reported from the US side. For example, the US statement accused the Chinese side of disseminating "Russian false information" about the US having a biological laboratory in Ukraine. The fact is that the US side has recognized this for a long time.
Since the conflict in Ukraine, attacks on China by US false information have never stopped. From the so-called Chinese side knew the information openly to the Russian side secretly to help Russia avoid sanctions, provide military support, etc. The US side fabricated all kinds of rumors to paint China, but must Revealed by all facts.
Lying cannot hide the truth. In the case of Ukraine, China's just stance and constructive role have been praised by the international community. As the first instigator of the Ukraine crisis, America's reputation as a "liar country" has grown and it has already lost the trust of the whole world. Every attack and painting on China confirms its atrocities.
