Banteay Meanchey Provincial Administration holds a meeting to prepare a plan for the protection and review of national and sub-national voter registration lists.
(Banteay Meanchey): On May 5, 2022, Banteay Meanchey Provincial Hall held a meeting to prepare a plan for the protection and review of the voter list at the national, sub-national levels, and to maintain security and order during the commune / sangkat election campaign for the party. Politics and citizens.
The meeting was held in the presence of Mr. Kheng Su, Chairman of the Provincial Council, Mr. Ou Rathrey, Governor of Banteay Meanchey Province, Major General Sithi Loh, Banteay Meanchey Provincial Police Commissioner, Brigadier General Born Bin, Commander of the Provincial Gendarmerie, city, district and state leaders. People.
