From the beginning of the election campaign until the announcement of the results of the Commune / Sangkat Council elections, the candidates must strive to strengthen the unity and good cooperation in finding the right votes for their party in accordance with the principles of the law.
He said that including the annual voter list and voter registration, as well as national and sub-national voter registration, during the voter registration process, the military police must be on standby. Throughout Banteay Meanchey province, especially in the area of polling stations in the province to maintain security and safety for the people.
