(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training on May 4, 2022 issued a press release from the Office of the Spokesperson of the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training on the employment issues of former employees of NagaWorld. This is according to a press release received by Fresh News on May 4.
