(Phnom Penh): Professor Mam Bunheng, Minister of Health, on May 4, 2022, opened a workshop on Strategies for the Management and Prevention of Blindness for Vision 2030 at the Khmer-Soviet Friendship Hospital, organized by the program National Eye Health and the International Agency for the Prevention of Blindness collaborate with development partners and NGOs.
