(Phnom Penh): On the morning of May 3, 2022, tomorrow, Dr. HUN Manet will represent the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen and meet with the media on the occasion of the 29th World Press Freedom Day. According to a letter from the Ministry of Information.
This day is organized by the Ministry of Information in order to promote the right to freedom of expression, freedom of the press and to encourage national and international journalists who are working in the field of information in Cambodia and around the world, as well as increase Intimacy between the leadership as well as the spokesperson with the media.
According to the agenda, the representative of the Ministry of Information will read the message of Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of the 29th World Press Freedom Day on May 3.
