Dr. Uy Sam Ath stated that "Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen always recommends that his subordinates inspect the actual situation to find the most vulnerable people, which is the priority of the Cambodian Red Cross to solve the difficulties of the people. "People who need help need to get to the back of the house without leaving anyone behind."
